  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">BPSC ASO Mains Result 2026</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-08-11T11:42:00+05:30\">August 11, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">11:42 am</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"http://www.bpsc.bih.nic.in/\">Bihar Public Service Commission (BPSC)</a>,</strong> has released the<strong> Mains Result </strong>on its\u00a0<strong>official website</strong> for the Recruitment of <strong>Assistant Section Officer ASO Mains Examination 2026.</strong> The\u00a0<strong>Exam</strong>\u00a0<span data-teams=\"true\">was conducted on<strong> 27 February 2026</strong></span><strong>,</strong>\u00a0The\u00a0<strong>BPSC</strong>\u00a0application process started on\u00a0<strong data-end=\"339\" data-start=\"319\">12 January 2026</strong>, and candidates were able to submit their applications until\u00a0<strong data-end=\"424\" data-start=\"401\">31 January 2026</strong>. Candidates can check their\u00a0<strong>Mains Result </strong>using their\u00a0<strong data-end=\"362\" data-start=\"302\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>\u00a0by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.\u00a0<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>(Advt. No. 37/2025)</strong></span></span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\