xt\">BPSC ASO Mains Result 2026</h2>\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">BPSC Assistant Section Officer ASO Examination 2025 : Short Details</h3>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/bpsc-aso-mains-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>29 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date : <strong>23 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date For Fee Payment : <strong>23 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Pre Exam Date :<strong> 10 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card :\u00a0<strong>04 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Pre Answer Key :<strong> 18 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Date : <strong>23 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Mains Form Start Date :<strong> 12 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Mains Form Last Date : <strong>31 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Mains Exam Date :<strong> 27 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Mains Admit Card : <strong>20 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Final Answer Key : <strong>06 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Mains Result : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>10 August 2026 Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <strong>Bihar</strong>\u00a0<strong>BPSC</strong> official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For<strong> General/ OBC/ EWS </strong>: <strong>\u20b9 600/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>SC/ ST/ Female Candidates Of Bihar</strong>\u00a0: <strong>\u20b9 150/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>PH Candidates</strong> : <strong>\u20b9 200/-</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">BPSC Assistant Section Officer ASO Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 01 August 2025</h5>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age